色帽子。周围是三个穿着蓝色和红色传统服装的小孩，一个孩子站在他的右边，左边有两个孩子。背景具有蓝天，蓬松的白色云层，底部有粉红色和黄色花的边界。汉字在左边垂直写。整体风格是异想天开和节日的。", "这是一个数字绘画风格的场景，在UE5中呈现，其散景背景由柔软的，灰色和白色的色调组成。中心人物是一个具有长长的黑发的角色，在高高的马尾辫上，带有松散的束缚。他们穿着传统的中国风格的和服，主要是深绿色，内层白色和黑色obi腰带。角色的表达集中和平静，眼睛略微闭合，表明了集中度或准备状态。他们的右手握着一把长长的剑，将其放在稍微向下。照明柔软且散布，产生柔和的阴影和亮点，增强了角色的宁静和确定的举止。相机角度略低，侧面略低，从而使角色的身高和存在感。背景是抽象和薄弱的，带有旋转的灰色和白色图案，为场景增添了运动感和深度。总体构图是动态但平衡的，强调了角色的既定和强大立场。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 88, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 54, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 30}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1, 11], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors", "wan", "default"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [412.7765808105469, 98], "pos": [66.66744995117188, 1028.5498046875], "id": 19, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [432.19781494140625, 437.0179138183594], "pos": [-1255.2537841796875, 1009.2182006835938], "widgets_values": ["This is a colorful, traditional Chinese-style illustration depicting a large, bearded man in ornate, floral-patterned robes, holding a tray with a teapot and fish, and reading a book. He wears a black and red hat adorned with flowers. Surrounding him are three young children dressed in blue and red traditional attire, with one child standing on his right and two on his left. The background features a blue sky with fluffy white clouds, and a border of pink and yellow flowers at the bottom. Chinese characters are written vertically on the left. The overall style is whimsical and festive.", "This is a digital painting-style scene, rendered in UE5, with a bokeh background composed of soft, gray, and white tones. The central figure is a character with long, flowing black hair, styled in a high ponytail with loose strands. They are wearing a traditional Chinese-style kimono, predominantly dark green with a white inner layer and a black obi belt. The character's expression is focused and calm, with slightly closed eyes, suggesting a state of concentration or readiness. They are holding a long, slender sword in their right hand, which is positioned slightly downward. The lighting is soft and diffused, creating gentle shadows and highlights that enhance the character's serene and determined demeanor. The camera angle is slightly low and to the side, giving a sense of the character's height and presence. The background is abstract and misty, with swirling gray and white patterns that add a sense of motion and depth to the scene. The overall composition is dynamic yet balanced, emphasizing the character's poised and powerful stance."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 84, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 50, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 27}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [590.1039428710938, 111.425048828125], "pos": [606.7464599609375, 531.05908203125], "widgets_values": ["WAN2.1_SmartphoneSnapshotPhotoReality_v1_by-AI_Characters.safetensors", 1.0000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 62, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "flags": {}, "id": 39, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.45", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOn